      "end_seconds": 2.028833,
      "text": "of ribbon."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 2.108833,
      "end_seconds": 3.035333,
      "text": "Can you wrap them all?"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 3.115333,
